flowchart TB
  U[Sales, Marketing, Admin Users] --> UI[React / Next.js]
  WEB[Owned Website Forms] --> PUB[Public Form API]
  UI --> API[Python Flask API]
  PUB --> API
  API --> DOMAIN[Domain Services]
  DOMAIN --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
  DOMAIN --> OUTBOX[Transactional Outbox]
  OUTBOX --> CELERY[Celery + Redis]
  CELERY --> AI[AI Orchestrator / Agent Workers]
  AI --> VEC[(pgvector)]
  AI --> KB[Private Object Storage]
  CELERY --> IMAP[IMAP Adapter]
  CELERY --> SMTP[SMTP Adapter]
  CELERY --> REPORT[Reporting Workers]
  DOMAIN --> AUDIT[Audit Log]
